# aswproject_dev — public site only

This app is **100% public**. Non-private content; no login; no SchoolBox or staff identity checks.

## Never add

- SchoolBox remote auth, HMAC, JWT, `staffId`, `staffEmail`, sessions, or login pages
- Includes from `custom/includes/`, `userRoles.php`, Synergetic auth, portalDb/staffDb for access control
- ICT-only gates, VLAN restrictions, or Apache/server config from this project

## Do

- Keep pages self-contained under `aswproject_dev/`
- Use local `assets/` CSS/fonts and `content/*.json` for data
- Escape HTML output; do not treat escaping as authorization

See `.docs/PUBLIC-SITE.md`.
